 "font_size": 14,
 "html": "<div>\r\n  {% if letter_head and not no_letterhead -%}\r\n    <div class=\"letter-head\">{{ letter_head }}</div>\r\n    <hr>\r\n  {%- endif %}\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"text-align:center; margin:2px 0;font-size:14px;\"><b>DISCHARGE FORM</b></h2>\r\n  <hr style=\"margin:2px 0;\">\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:0; padding:0; font-size:12px;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Date:</strong> {{ doc.get_formatted('date') or ''}}\r\n      </td>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:right; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>No:</strong> {{ doc.name or ''}}\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n  <hr style=\"margin:2px 0;\">\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:0; padding:0;font-size:12px;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Pet Name:</strong> \r\n        {{doc. patient_fullname or ''}}\r\n      </td>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:right; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Pet Owner:</strong> {{ doc.customer_fullname or ''}}\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n       <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Follow-up Visit Date:</strong> {{ doc.get_formatted(\"follow_up_visit_date\") or '' }}\r\n       </td>\r\n       <td style=\"text-align:right; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Owner Phone No:</strong> {{ doc.owner_phone_no or '' }}\r\n       </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        {% if doc.veterinarian_name %}\r\n    {% set vet = frappe.get_doc(\"Healthcare Practitioner\", doc.veterinarian_name) %}\r\n    <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Veterinarian Name:</strong> {{ vet.practitioner_name }}\r\n    </td>\r\n{% else %}\r\n    <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Veterinarian Name:</strong>\r\n    </td>\r\n{% endif %}\r\n\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n <p><strong>For the recovery care of your pet please read the following information.</strong></p>\r\n <p>Diagnosis: {{doc.diagnosis or ''}}</p>\r\n<p><strong>Outpatient Medicines with instructions</strong></p>\r\n <ol>\r\n  {% if doc.med1 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med1 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n  {% if doc.med2 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med2 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n  {% if doc.med3 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med3 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n  {% if doc.med4 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med4 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </ol>\r\n <p><strong>Status of pet condition at the time of discharge: </strong>\r\n {% if doc.fully_recovered ==1 %} \r\n   <i>Fully Recovered</i>\r\n  {% else %}\r\n    <i>In recovery stage </i>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </p>\r\n <p><strong>Diet: </strong>\r\n {% if doc.normal ==1 %} \r\n   <i>Normal</i>\r\n  {% else %}\r\n    <i>Other </i>\r\n    {{doc.data_pkef or ''}}\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </p>\r\n <p><strong>Exercise: </strong>\r\n {% if doc.no_restrictions ==1 %} \r\n   <i>No restrictions</i>\r\n  {% else %}\r\n    <i>Other </i>\r\n    {{doc.data_wqug or ''}}\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </p>\r\n {% if doc. small_text_mplj %} \r\n <p><strong>Special Instructions, if any</strong> <br>\r\n {{doc.small_text_mplj or ''}}</p>\r\n {% endif %}\r\n <p>Kindly follow all instructions otherwise vet will not be responsible for any mishap with your pet at your place,\r\n In case any emerency prior to the follow-up visit date, bring the pet to the clinic.</p>\r\n <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:1px; padding-top:2px;\">\r\n  <span style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding:1px 4px; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap;\">\r\n    Instructions After Every Surgery\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:10px; margin-top:8px; page-break-inside:avoid;\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding:6px;\">\r\n      <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:16px; list-style-type:disc;\">\r\n        <li>Don't feed 6 hours after waking up from anesthesia or sedation.</li>\r\n        <li>Must give medicines as prescribed by veterinarian.</li>\r\n        <li>Must put on e-collar for 7 days.</li>\r\n        <li>Apply wound cream at least twice a day for 7 days.</li>\r\n        <li>Shower is not allowed 7 days after surgery.</li>\r\n        <li>In case stitches are open or wound get infected, bring back to clinic for concerned vet.</li>\r\n        <li>Free follow-up within 5 days after surgery.</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </td>\r\n\r\n    <td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top; padding:6px; direction:rtl; text-align:right; font-family:'Arial Unicode MS','Simplified Arabic',sans-serif;\">\r\n      <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-right:16px; list-style-type:disc;\">\r\n        <li>\u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0637\u0639\u0645 \u062d\u064a\u0648\u0627\u0646\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0644\u064a\u0641 \u0625\u0644\u0627 \u0628\u0639\u062f 6 \u0633\u0627\u0639\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u064a\u0642\u0627\u0638 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062e\u062f\u064a\u0631 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0647\u062f\u0626\u0629.</li>\r\n        <li>\u064a\u062c\u0628 \u0625\u0639\u0637\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0643\u0645\u0627 \u0647\u0648 \u0645\u0648\u0635\u0648\u0641 \u0645\u0646 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0637\u0631\u064a.</li>\r\n        <li>\u064a\u062c\u0628 \u0648\u0636\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0648\u0642 \u0644\u0645\u062f\u0629 7 \u0623\u064a\u0627\u0645.</li>\r\n        <li>\u064a\u0648\u0636\u0639 \u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0631\u062d \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0642\u0644 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u064a\u0646 \u064a\u0648\u0645\u064a\u0627\u064b \u0644\u0645\u062f\u0629 7 \u0623\u064a\u0627\u0645.</li>\r\n        <li>\u0644\u0627 \u064a\u0633\u0645\u062d \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u062d\u0645\u0627\u0645 \u0625\u0644\u0627 \u0628\u0639\u062f 7 \u0623\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0629.</li>\r\n        <li>\u0641\u064a \u062d\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0641\u062a\u062d \u0627\u0644\u063a\u0631\u0632 \u0623\u0648 \u0625\u0635\u0627\u0628\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0631\u062d \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u062f\u0648\u0649\u060c \u064a\u062c\u0628 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u064a\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0637\u0631\u064a.</li>\r\n        <li>\u0645\u062a\u0627\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u0645\u062c\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u062e\u0644\u0627\u0644 5 \u0623\u064a\u0627\u0645 \u0628\u0639\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0629.</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:5px; border-collapse:collapse;\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n\r\n    <td style=\"width:50%; padding:0; text-align:left;\">\r\n      <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"height:120px; vertical-align:bottom; text-align:center;\">\r\n            {% if doc.owner_signature %}\r\n              <img src=\"{{ doc.owner_signature }}\"style=\"max-width:220px; max-height:80px; display:block; margin:0 auto 6px;\" />\r\n            {% else %}\r\n              <div style=\"width:220px; height:80px; border-bottom:1px solid #333; margin:0 auto 6px;\"></div>\r\n            {% endif %}\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;\">Owner/Pet Receiver signature</div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n\r\n    <td style=\"width:50%; padding:0; text-align:right;\">\r\n      <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"height:120px; vertical-align:bottom; text-align:center;\">\r\n            {% if doc.veterinarian_signature %}\r\n              <img src=\"{{ doc.veterinarian_signature }}\"\r\n                   style=\"max-width:220px; max-height:80px; display:block; margin:0 auto 6px;\" />\r\n            {% else %}\r\n              <div style=\"width:220px; height:80px; border-bottom:1px solid #333; margin:0 auto 6px;\"></div>\r\n            {% endif %}\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;\">Veterinarian / Discharged by</div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n",
